  "items": [
    {
      "source": "Create a fully configured <a href=\"TypePatternClassFilter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.aspectj\"><code>TypePatternClassFilter</code></a> using the\ngiven type pattern.",
      "translation": "使用给定的类型模式创建一个完全配置的<a href=\"TypePatternClassFilter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.aspectj\"><code>TypePatternClassFilter</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>typePattern</code> - the type pattern that AspectJ weaver should parse",
      "translation": "<code>typePattern</code> - AspectJ 织机应解析的类型模式",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "This is the JavaBean constructor; be sure to set the\n<a href=\"#setTypePattern(java.lang.String)\"><code>typePattern</code></a> property, else a\nno doubt fatal <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a> will be thrown\nwhen the <a href=\"#matches(java.lang.Class)\"><code>matches(Class)</code></a> method is first invoked.",
      "translation": "这是 JavaBean 构造函数；请务必设置 `<a href=\"#setTypePattern(java.lang.String)\"><code>typePattern</code></a>` 属性，否则在首次调用 `<a href=\"#matches(java.lang.Class)\"><code>matches(Class)</code></a>` 方法时，很可能会抛出 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Examples include:\n<code class=\"code\">\norg.springframework.beans.*\n</code>\nThis will match any class or interface in the given package.\n<code class=\"code\">\norg.springframework.beans.ITestBean+\n</code>\nThis will match the <code>ITestBean</code> interface and any class\nthat implements it.",
      "translation": "示例包括：\n<code class=\"code\">\norg.springframework.beans.*\n</code>\n这将匹配给定包中的任何类或接口。\n<code class=\"code\">\norg.springframework.beans.ITestBean+\n</code>\n这将匹配 <code>ITestBean</code> 接口以及实现该接口的任何类。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "These conventions are established by AspectJ, not Spring AOP.",
      "translation": "这些约定由 AspectJ 建立，而非 Spring AOP。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new instance of the <a href=\"TypePatternClassFilter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.aspectj\"><code>TypePatternClassFilter</code></a> class.",
      "translation": "创建 `<a href=\"TypePatternClassFilter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.aspectj\"><code>TypePatternClassFilter</code></a>` 类的新实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the AspectJ type pattern to match.",
      "translation": "返回要匹配的 AspectJ 类型模式。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Should the pointcut apply to the given interface or target class?",
      "translation": "该切入点应应用于给定的接口还是目标类？",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - if no <a href=\"#setTypePattern(java.lang.String)\"><code>setTypePattern(String)</code></a> has been set",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - 如果尚未设置 <a href=\"#setTypePattern(java.lang.String)\"><code>setTypePattern(String)</code></a>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>clazz</code> - candidate target class",
      "translation": "<code>clazz</code> - 候选目标类",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "whether the advice should apply to this candidate target class",
      "translation": "该建议是否应适用于此候选目标类",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
